From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ruhan <35257374+RuhanSA079@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 6 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] radxa-cm3-io: disable rk817's internal RTC

With the external HYM8563 (previous patch) present, keep only one
system RTC. Requires the previous mfd: rk808 patch to actually take
effect -- see that patch for why a plain status="disabled" child here
does nothing without it.

Verified the full board dtb still compiles and this node resolves as
a child of the rk817 pmic node.

---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3566-radxa-cm3-io.dts | 6 ++++++
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3566-radxa-cm3-io.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3566-radxa-cm3-io.dts
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3566-radxa-cm3-io.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3566-radxa-cm3-io.dts
@@ -99,6 +99,12 @@
 	};
 };

+&rk817 {
+	rtc {
+		status = "disabled";
+	};
+};
+
 &i2s0_8ch {
 	status = "okay";
 };
--
